13is|n|Rapid or incoherent talk, with indistinct utterance; gibberish. ; One who jabbers.	a:cwf,97,7;1bbh,28,3;1ta1,10,1;1e3p,9,2;1zml,8,1~cwf,97,7;1bbh,28,3;1e3p,9,2;1zml,8,1;1ta1,10,1	v:1ta1,10,1;26eh,0,3~26eh,0,3;1ta1,10,1	n:277w,28,5;1f2t,10,2~277w,28,5;1f2t,10,2	N:1mck,50,3;d6d,49,6;kl,32,4;1tsz,20,3;1tt1,11,1~d6d,49,6;kl,32,4;1tsz,20,3;1mck,50,3;1tt1,11,1
